<title>PORTUGAL: Hypo-bank launches 10 bln esc, 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Hypo-bank launches 10 bln esc, 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Banco Cisf.</p>
<p>BORROWER  Bayerische Hypotheken und Wechsel Bank.</p>
<p>    AMT 10 billion escudos    MATURITY 20/2/2007</p>
<p>    ISS PRICE Par		 PAY DATE 20/2/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY Aa2  LAST S&amp;P A+ LAST IBCA AA</p>
<p>    LISTING Lux		   DENOMS 10 million esc</p>
<p>INTEREST Lisbor six months plus 30 basis points to a maximum of 8.25 percent</p>
<p>PAY FREQUENCY Six monthly GOV LAW English</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
